{
 "chunk": 50,
 "chunks_total": 97,
 "entries": 70,
 "lines": 165,
 "items": [
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text07",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text07",
   "en": "I can only send a little bit of\nmy power here.  But I have a\nrequest.{END}",
   "max_units": 76,
   "units": 76,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text08",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text08",
   "en": "A request?\nFrom Your Majesty?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 35,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text09",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text09",
   "en": "Riku, don't let go of yourself\njust because darkness has a\nhold on you.{END}",
   "max_units": 78,
   "units": 78,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text10",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text10",
   "en": "Fight the darkness inside you!\nIt won't be easy…{END}",
   "max_units": 54,
   "units": 54,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text11",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text11",
   "en": "But don’t forget!\nEven in the darkest darkness,\nthere’s always a little light.{END}",
   "max_units": 85,
   "units": 85,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text12",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text12",
   "en": "Light…within darkness?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 27,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text13",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text13",
   "en": "You and I have seen it!\nThe far-off, welcoming light\ninside the door to darkness…{END}",
   "max_units": 88,
   "units": 88,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text14",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text14",
   "en": "The light of Kingdom Hearts,\nRiku―it'll show you the way.{END}",
   "max_units": 63,
   "units": 63,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text15",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text15",
   "en": "Please don’t give up.  Believe\nin the light.  That’s all I ask.{END}",
   "max_units": 69,
   "units": 69,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text16",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text16",
   "en": "Okay…I’ll try my best.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 27,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text17",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text17",
   "en": "And I’ll try to find a way to\nreach you.  I’ll come, I promise.{END}",
   "max_units": 69,
   "units": 69,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text18",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text18",
   "en": "You’re…an illusion?\nMy hand passes right through\nyou.{END}",
   "max_units": 60,
   "units": 60,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text19",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text19",
   "en": "But we shook hands, in our\nhearts.  We’re connected, you\nand me.{END}",
   "max_units": 71,
   "units": 71,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent158Text20",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent158Text20",
   "en": "Yeah…I guess so.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 21,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text00",
   "en": "I’ve identified the scent.\nIt’s Riku.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 43,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text01",
   "en": "Riku?\nBut Riku is gone!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 29,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text02",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text02",
   "en": "He and that king were lost\nwhen they ventured beyond\nthe door to darkness.\nHow could he have escaped?{END}",
   "max_units": 109,
   "units": 109,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text03",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text03",
   "en": "Riku once shouldered the\ndarkness.  Perhaps that made\nhim half-dark.{END}",
   "max_units": 75,
   "units": 75,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text04",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text04",
   "en": "And that’s why you mistook\nhim for the Superior.\nFascinating…{END}",
   "max_units": 68,
   "units": 68,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text05",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text05",
   "en": "The dark power given to Riku\nfacilitated his escape from the\nrealm of darkness.{END}",
   "max_units": 86,
   "units": 86,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text06",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text06",
   "en": "One with ties to both the\nKeyblade and the powers of\ndarkness…\nThis merits further research.{END}",
   "max_units": 100,
   "units": 100,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text07",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text07",
   "en": "What I want to know is why\nRiku appeared here in Castle\nOblivion.{END}",
   "max_units": 72,
   "units": 72,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text08",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text08",
   "en": "Ha!  That’s simple.\nHis existence resonates with\nthat of another hero.{END}",
   "max_units": 77,
   "units": 77,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text09",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text09",
   "en": "Sora came, so Riku followed.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 33,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text10",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text10",
   "en": "Sora’s in the castle?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 26,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text11",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text11",
   "en": "Yes, he and his companions\narrived earlier.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 49,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text12",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text12",
   "en": "By now that dog Marluxia is\nalready using Naminé to meddle\nwith Sora’s heart.{END}",
   "max_units": 84,
   "units": 84,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text13",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text13",
   "en": "Interesting.\nI had no idea.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 33,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text14",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text14",
   "en": "I don’t think Marluxia plans to\nhand Sora over, but…he can\nplay his little game.{END}",
   "max_units": 87,
   "units": 87,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text15",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text15",
   "en": "If he gets Sora, then we need\nonly acquire Riku.{END}",
   "max_units": 54,
   "units": 54,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent159Text16",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent159Text16",
   "en": "If he truly is like the Superior,\nthen we will be untouchable!{END}",
   "max_units": 68,
   "units": 68,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent160Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent160Text00",
   "en": "Riku, I presume?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 21,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent160Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent160Text01",
   "en": "Who are you?\nAre you with Ansem?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 38,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent160Text02",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent160Text02",
   "en": "You are half correct.\nLet us say that it’s not the\nAnsem you know.{END}",
   "max_units": 73,
   "units": 73,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent160Text03",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent160Text03",
   "en": "He is Ansem and he is not―\nwhich is to say he is nobody.{END}",
   "max_units": 62,
   "units": 62,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent160Text04",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent160Text04",
   "en": "Nobody, huh?\nSorry, riddles aren’t my thing.\nTry making some sense.{END}",
   "max_units": 74,
   "units": 74,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent160Text05",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent160Text05",
   "en": "He belongs to neither the\nlight nor the dark, but walks\nthe twilight between.\nAs do I.\nAnd for that matter―{END}",
   "max_units": 116,
   "units": 116,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent160Text06",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent160Text06",
   "en": "Ha ha, that's right.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 25,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent160Text07",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent160Text07",
   "en": "We have much in common.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 28,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent160Text08",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent160Text08",
   "en": "Maybe we do…{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 17,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent160Text09",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent160Text09",
   "en": "But so what!\nIs that an invitation to join\nyour club?{END}",
   "max_units": 60,
   "units": 60,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent160Text10",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent160Text10",
   "en": "Yeah, there’s darkness inside\nme, just like you said.{END}",
   "max_units": 59,
   "units": 59,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent160Text11",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent160Text11",
   "en": "But darkness is my enemy!\n\n\nAnd you are, too, for making\neverything around here reek\nof it!{END}",
   "max_units": 101,
   "units": 101,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 6
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent160Text12",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent160Text12",
   "en": "Oh ho, so it’s a fight you want.\nVery well―a fight you shall\nget!{END}",
   "max_units": 72,
   "units": 72,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent161Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent161Text00",
   "en": "Ha ha ha…\nThis battle has made it clear.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 46,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent161Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent161Text01",
   "en": "The darkness coursing\nthrough you is a tremendous\npower.\nAll you needed was the right\nprovocation.{END}",
   "max_units": 107,
   "units": 107,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent161Text02",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent161Text02",
   "en": "Great.\nSo this was a trick?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 33,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent161Text03",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent161Text03",
   "en": "Precisely.\nYour fiery reaction provided\njust the data I needed.{END}",
   "max_units": 70,
   "units": 70,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent161Text04",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent161Text04",
   "en": "You have my thanks, Riku!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 30,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent162Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent162Text00",
   "en": "Where did Vexen go?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 24,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent162Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent162Text01",
   "en": "He’s off using Riku’s data to\ncreate some kind of replica.{END}",
   "max_units": 64,
   "units": 64,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent162Text02",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent162Text02",
   "en": "And what of Sora?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 22,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent162Text03",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent162Text03",
   "en": "Naminé is shuffling his\nmemories even as we speak.{END}",
   "max_units": 56,
   "units": 56,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent162Text04",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent162Text04",
   "en": "Marluxia may well get his\npuppet.  He's a danger to us\nall.{END}",
   "max_units": 66,
   "units": 66,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent162Text05",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent162Text05",
   "en": "Larxene’s not to be trusted,\neither.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 42,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent162Text06",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent162Text06",
   "en": "Nor is Axel.\nWho knows what that one is\nthinking…{END}",
   "max_units": 56,
   "units": 56,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent162Text07",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent162Text07",
   "en": "Let’s observe a little longer,\nthen speak with Vexen.{END}",
   "max_units": 59,
   "units": 59,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent162Text08",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent162Text08",
   "en": "But Vexen despises Marluxia.\nThink of the mess it would\ncreate…{END}",
   "max_units": 70,
   "units": 70,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent162Text09",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent162Text09",
   "en": "That’s why Vexen must be\ntold.  Better he clean up the\nmess than us.{END}",
   "max_units": 75,
   "units": 75,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent163Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent163Text00",
   "en": "What the…{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 14,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent163Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent163Text01",
   "en": "What are you supposed to be?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 33,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent163Text02",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent163Text02",
   "en": "Surprised?\nI guess you would be.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 38,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent163Text03",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent163Text03",
   "en": "I bet it's not every day you\nmeet your twin.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 50,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent163Text04",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent163Text04",
   "en": "Too shocked to speak?\nThis should come as a relief,\nthen:{END}",
   "max_units": 64,
   "units": 64,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent163Text05",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent163Text05",
   "en": "I'm a replica of you that Vexen\nmade.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 43,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent163Text06",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent163Text06",
   "en": "What, you mean a fake me?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 30,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent163Text07",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent163Text07",
   "en": "I didn't say “fake”!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 25,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent163Text08",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent163Text08",
   "en": "Just because you're real\ndoesn't mean you're better!{END}",
   "max_units": 58,
   "units": 58,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent163Text09",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent163Text09",
   "en": "We share the same body and\nthe same talents.\n\nThere is one easy way to tell\nus apart, though.{END}",
   "max_units": 102,
